completed_at: "2026-09-09T05:29:21.810Z"
author: maintainer-agent
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "context noun exposes next and focus verbs with payloads identical to the standalone commands; pm next / pm focus keep working as aliases with suppressible hints; spelling-parity spec green; contracts, completions, docs, and MCP names regenerated; top-level help shows a single navigation noun."
parent: pm-n7rr
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: Delivered native context next and context focus with permanent compatibility aliases and unchanged SDK semantics.
expected_result: Native context navigation and legacy aliases preserve payloads and focus persistence with bounded discovery.
actual_result: All namespace acceptance checks passed; 8639 tests and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage; full static and distribution gates passed.
